<title>UK: London precious metals end quiet day mixed.</title>
<headline>London precious metals end quiet day mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closes barely changed at $341.50/342.00, up just 20 cents. Tightly range bound and quiet.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finishes one cent lower at $4.71/4.73.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ends $11.00 lower at $426.00/431.00 after running into light New York-based selling.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Finishes just $1 lower at $201.00/206.00 after probing $200 support area.</p>
</text>
